@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ===== LYCKADE ANROP =====

### Hämta alla boenden → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties

### Skapa boende → 201 (KÖR DENNA FÖRST – de andra använder dess id)
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Villa vid havet",
  "description": "Stor villa med havsutsikt",
  "location": "Göteborg, Sverige",
  "price_per_night": 2500,
  "max_guests": 6
}

### Hämta det skapade boendet → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Ändra pris → 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price_per_night": 2200
}

### ===== NEKADE ANROP =====

### Klienten försöker välja eget id → id ignoreras (201 med databasens id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "hackad",
  "title": "Fusk-boende",
  "description": "Test",
  "location": "Malmö, Sverige",
  "price_per_night": 500,
  "max_guests": 2
}

### Ogiltigt pris → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gratis-boende",
  "description": "Test",
  "location": "Umeå, Sverige",
  "price_per_night": "gratis",
  "max_guests": 2
}

### PATCH med ogiltigt pris → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price_per_night": "gratis"
}

### PATCH utan fält → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Ogiltigt id (inte UUID) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/abc

### Okänt id (giltig UUID som inte finns) → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Okänd route → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/finns-inte

### Trasig JSON → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{ detta är inte json

### ===== TA BORT (KÖR SIST) =====

### Ta bort det skapade boendet → 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Kontroll: boendet är borta → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/{{created.response.body.id}}

### ===== AUTH =====

### Registrera med ogiltig data → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "inte-en-epost", "password": "123" }

### Logga in med fel lösenord → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "fel-losen" }

### Logga in → 200 (REST Client sparar cookien)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_PASSWORD}}" }

### Vem är inloggad? → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Logga ut → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Vem är inloggad efter utloggning? → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Logga ut först
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Skapa boende utloggad → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Utan inloggning",
  "description": "Test",
  "location": "Luleå, Sverige",
  "price_per_night": 700,
  "max_guests": 2
}
### ===== FAS 6: ÄGARSKAP =====

### 1. Logga in som användare A
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_PASSWORD}}" }

### 2. A skapar ett boende
# @name ownedByA
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "A:s stuga", "description": "Ägs av A", "location": "Dalarna", "price_per_night": 900, "max_guests": 4 }

### 3. Logga in som användare B (cookien byts ut)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_PASSWORD}}" }

### 4. B försöker ändra A:s boende → 403
PATCH http://localhost:3000/properties/{{ownedByA.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_per_night": 1 }

### 5. B försöker ta bort A:s boende → 403
DELETE http://localhost:3000/properties/{{ownedByA.response.body.id}}

### 6. Logga in som A igen
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_PASSWORD}}" }

### 7. A ändrar sitt eget boende → 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/properties/{{ownedByA.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_per_night": 950 }

### 8. A tar bort sitt eget boende → 200
DELETE http://localhost:3000/properties/{{ownedByA.response.body.id}}

### ===== FAS 7: FILTER OCH SORTERING =====

### Filtrera på plats (skiftlägesokänsligt) → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?location=stock

### Maxpris + antal gäster → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?max_price=1000&guests=2

### Sortera billigast först → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?sort=price_asc

### Sortera dyrast först → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?sort=price_desc

### Alla filter kombinerade → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?location=a&max_price=2000&guests=1&sort=price_asc

### NEKAD: maxpris som text → 400
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?max_price=gratis

### NEKAD: ogiltig sortering → 400
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?sort=random

### NEKAD: 0 gäster → 400
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?guests=0
### ===== FAS 8: BOKNINGAR =====

### 1. Logga in som A (värd)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_PASSWORD}}" }

### 2. A skapar ett boende (max 3 gäster, 500 kr/natt)
# @name hostProperty
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Värdens hus", "description": "Test", "location": "Göteborg", "price_per_night": 500, "max_guests": 3 }

### 3. Logga in som B (gäst)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_PASSWORD}}" }

### 4. B bokar – fuskpris och status ignoreras → 201, total_price 1500 (VG6)
# @name booking
POST http://localhost:3000/properties/{{hostProperty.response.body.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guest_name": "Erik", "guest_email": "erik@test.se", "guests": 2, "check_in": "2026-12-01", "check_out": "2026-12-04", "total_price": 1, "status": "confirmed" }

### 5. NEKAD: överlappande datum → 409 (VG2)
POST http://localhost:3000/properties/{{hostProperty.response.body.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guest_name": "Erik", "guest_email": "erik@test.se", "guests": 1, "check_in": "2026-12-03", "check_out": "2026-12-06" }

### 6. NEKAD: för många gäster → 400 (VG3)
POST http://localhost:3000/properties/{{hostProperty.response.body.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guest_name": "Erik", "guest_email": "erik@test.se", "guests": 9, "check_in": "2027-01-01", "check_out": "2027-01-02" }

### 7. NEKAD: ogiltig e-post, 0 gäster, utcheckning före incheckning → 400 (G10)
POST http://localhost:3000/properties/{{hostProperty.response.body.id}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guest_name": "Erik", "guest_email": "inte-en-epost", "guests": 0, "check_in": "2026-12-05", "check_out": "2026-12-01" }

### 8. B ser sina bokningar → 200 (VG1)
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings

### 9. Logga in som A igen
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_A_PASSWORD}}" }

### 10. Värden ser alla bokningar på sitt boende → 200 (G12, VG1)
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/{{hostProperty.response.body.id}}/bookings

### 11. NEKAD: värden försöker ändra gästens bokning → 403 (VG1)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guests": 1 }

### 12. Logga in som B igen
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_B_PASSWORD}}" }

### 13. B avbokar → 200, status cancelled (G12)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cancelled" }

### 14. B tar bort sin bokning → 200 (G12)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{booking.response.body.id}}
